    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mission\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1581,1589]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "At the start of a play session, roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1589,1626]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on the Mission table below to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1626,1656]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "determine what you must do to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1656,1686]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "win this session of the game. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1686,1719]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you roll the same Mission that you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1719,1754]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "played last time, you may reroll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1754,1787]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "until you select a different one. To\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1787,1824]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "win the campaign, you must close\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1824,1857]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "seven Hell Gates in any number\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1857,1888]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of games.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1888,1897]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mission table to determine what). Do not roll on the rewards table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,1699,1767]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The reward for the quest, if completed, will be d6 vials of holy water\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,1767,1838]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and 1 holy symbol, that you will receive when you return here.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,1838,1901]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 Play Event #2. This is not a unique event. You may play this multiple\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,1901,1973]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "times during the game.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,1973,1996]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Feel free to add details about the place of worship based on any real world religion\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,1996,2081]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of your choice. You may pick up an appropriate religious symbol every time you visit\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,2081,2166]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a place of worship. Negligible weight.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[46,2166,2204]]"
    }
  ],
